{"id":"647983","name":"香辣豆花粉","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/647983/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红薯粉","amount":"100g"},{"name":"豆花","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"小白菜叶","amount":"50g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"红薯粉用清水泡软。","img":"images/647983/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入盐煮开。","img":"images/647983/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入小白菜叶一起煮。","img":"images/647983/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煮开后捞出红薯粉和菜叶。","img":"images/647983/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入内酯豆腐。","img":"images/647983/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煮开后倒出。","img":"images/647983/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"三种食材准备好了。","img":"images/647983/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入老干妈和辣椒油。","img":"images/647983/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搅拌均匀即可食用。","img":"images/647983/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}